{% set speakingNpc = decnpc(npc.UUID) %}
{% set nearby = get_nearby_unleashed_actors(npc.UUID) %}
{% set holders = get_nearby_actors(npc.UUID) %}
{{speakingNpc.name}} puts a new leash on a nearby unleashed person. Hold it, hand it to someone else, or leave it hanging (holder None). Use this to START a leash. Not for changing or removing an existing one, and not for tying to a point (use the tie action).
Available targets (who gets the collar): {{ nearby.actorsNameString }}.
Available holders (who holds the leash): {{speakingNpc.name}}, {{ holders.actorsNameString }}, or None.
Never pick the leashed actor as holder. Never pick anyone not listed except None.
